@startuml card-purchase-status
title card.domain — PurchaseStatus

' Status order is fixed. SETTLED is the customer posting, not the merchant payment.

skinparam shadowing false

[*] --> REQUESTED : authorize

REQUESTED --> AUTHORIZED : AuthorizationHold opened\njournal unchanged
AUTHORIZED --> CLEARED : ClearingItem inserted\njournal unchanged
CLEARED --> SETTLED : post customer\n2100 → 2300\nhold released
SETTLED --> POSTED : settle merchant\n2300 → 2200 + 4100\nSettlement inserted

POSTED --> [*]

note right of SETTLED
  The customer is posted.
  The amount sits in Settlement Suspense.
end note

note right of POSTED
  The merchant has been paid
  and the interchange fee stays with the bank.
end note

note bottom
  Unknown card and insufficient available balance
  write no Purchase, so they never enter this machine.
  Each arrow is its own transaction.
end note

@enduml
